  "description": "Mustache-style variable substitution for NuStreamDocs markdown. Pre-render preprocessor that walks UTF-8 source, skips fenced + inline code regions, and replaces `{{ name }}` markers with values from a host-supplied variables dictionary. Closes the mkdocs-macros gap; AOT-clean (byte-level scanner, no reflection).",
